<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SYSTEM_01 | Visual Language</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            /* Design Tokens */
            --bg: #0A0A0A;
            --fg: #FFFFFF;
            --accent: #00FF88;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --blur: blur(32px);
            
            /* Constraints */
            --unit: 8px;
            --container: 1100px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            cursor: crosshair; /* Brutalist touch */
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--fg);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.5;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Typography */
        h1, h2, .mono {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        /* Grid Background */
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: calc(var(--unit) * 4) calc(var(--unit) * 4);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        /* Layout */
        .container {
            max-width: var(--container);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: calc(var(--unit) * 10) calc(var(--unit) * 4);
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: var(--border);
            padding-bottom: calc(var(--unit) * 4);
            margin-bottom: calc(var(--unit) * 8);
        }

        .hero {
            height: 60vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            border-bottom: var(--border);
        }

        /* Components */
        .card {
            background: var(--glass);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur);
            border: var(--border);
            padding: calc(var(--unit) * 4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: calc(var(--unit) * 2) calc(var(--unit) * 4);
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--fg);
            color: var(--fg);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: var(--accent);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--bg);
        }

        .accent-text { color: var(--accent); }

        /* Grid System */
        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: calc(var(--unit) * 4);
            margin-top: calc(var(--unit) * 8);
        }

        /* Philosophical Footer */
        footer {
            margin-top: calc(var(--unit) * 20);
            padding-top: calc(var(--unit) * 4);
            border-top: var(--border);
            opacity: 0.5;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="mono">System_01 // <span class="accent-text">Active</span></div>
        </header>

        <section class="hero">
            <h1 style="font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px); line-height: 0.9;">
                Code is the <br> <span class="accent-text">Aesthetic.</span>
            </h1>
            <p style="margin-top: 24px; max-width: 400px; opacity: 0.8;">
                Visual language built on constraints. 
                Designed to make complexity visible.
            </p>
        </section>

        <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="mono">01_Clarity</h2>
                <p>No mystery. No confusion. Every pixel has a functional purpose.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="mono">02_Depth</h2>
                <p>Information density balanced by glassmorphism and negative space.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="mono">03_Speed</h2>
                <p>Built for the edge. Optimized for Vercel. Deployed in seconds.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 80px; text-align: center;">
            <a href="#" class="btn">INITIALIZE SYSTEM</a>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <div class="mono">Built with intention. No compromise. © 2026</div>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
